// Download A device's claim on one title's file for a profile. Once status is
// ready, url is the file: a GET with the device's token as
// `Authorization: Bearer`, in ranges as the client likes, resumed
// with Range and If-Range (its ETag); after a failure the client asks
// again from where it stopped. The device's text subtitles are
// fetched the same way. A device locked at Who's watching is answered
// 403 device_locked until a profile is picked, and a signed-out one
// 401. A download that went answers 404: the client creates it again.
// estimated is set while sizeBytes is a prediction; progress is the
// share of a conversion made.
//
// Instead of polling, a client may fetch the file before it is ready
// with `?wait=1`, at `/api/v2/downloads/{id}/file`, url's path once
// ready: the request is held until the conversion is ready and then
